'''''Pallbearing Merchant, Swordwielding Recruit''''' is an [[Adventure Mission]] on [[The Xianzhou Luofu]].

==Steps==
# Talk with Sushang
# Cross Cloudford and reconvene with the Express Crew
# Go around Cloudford and reconvene with the Express Crew
# Leave Cloudford via a starskiff

